{
  "name": "Tumbling Fool",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You master a variety of acrobatic techniques that allow you to evade danger. As a Bonus Action, you can tumble. When you tumble, you gain the following benefits for the rest of your turn:</p><ul><li>You gain the benefits of taking the Dash and Disengage actions.</li><li>You gain a Climb Speed equal to your current Speed.</li><li>You take half damage from falling.</li></ul>",
